+  <p><strong>Dust Mite Allergy Relief: An Allergist's Bedroom Checklist.</strong> The five steps, in order, plus the math on the mattress myth. <a href="/dust-mite-allergy">Read the checklist</a>.</p>
+  <p><strong>Does Hypoallergenic Mean Allergy Free?</strong> The label decoder, and the two words to look for instead. <a href="/hypoallergenic-skin-care">Read the guide</a>.</p>
