+
+  <p><strong>P.S.</strong> I saw the Broadway play “Buena Vista Social Club” this week with a friend who also loves Broadway. It was more than I expected it to be. Aside from being a beautiful artistic display of Cuban music, dance, costume and culture, it shares the story of two sisters; how their dreams, passions and love paved the way for each of their lives and how powerful both choices and nostalgia can be.</p>
+
+  <p>If you are ready to make room for something bigger, <a href="/free-session">your first coaching session is free</a>.</p>
