+      <h3 class="sl-pick-title">A Therapist's Emotional Tool Kit for a Better Holiday Season</h3>
+      <p>Modern Love from The New York Times, with therapist Nedra Glover Tawwab. Why the holidays pull us back into old family roles, how to handle host anxiety, and a simple tool kit: plan ahead, make new agreements with yourself, and shape a holiday that fits you.</p>
