+      <p class="sl-pick-num">02 &middot; Read</p>
+      <h3 class="sl-pick-title">Even a Joyous Holiday Season Can Cause Stress for Most Americans</h3>
+      <p>American Psychological Association, on its November 2023 Harris Poll of 2,061 adults. Money, gifts and missing loved ones topped the list.</p>
+      <p><strong>My take:</strong> <em>One of the best ways to reduce stress during the holidays is setting boundaries. On how others treat you, what you expect of yourself, of others; how much to spend. Think of what the alternatives are to spending money that could bring you just as much happiness and joy as that money.</em></p>
