+  <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--gray);">These are affiliate links. I may earn a commission, at no cost to you. More picks on my <a href="/recommendations">recommendations page</a>.</p>
+
+  <p><strong>P.S. </strong>This week I have taken on something completely new. It is something that I never thought I'd do because I didn't think I had the skill or qualifications. But once I began I realized my fear was unfounded and grounded in imposter syndrome. My students this week reminded me that “fake it ‘till you make it” is how we grow. If we don’t try, we remain paralyzed, afraid to make the first move, afraid of failing. Trying, and succeeding, even if it is only part of the time, gives us confidence to keep trying, growing, and moving forward.</p>
