+
+  <h1 class="post-h1">How to Build a Habit That Sticks, and <em>How Long It Really Takes</em></h1>
+
+  <p class="post-script">small, repeated, and a little boring</p>
+
+  <div class="post-meta-row">
+    <span class="post-meta-author">Lauren Fine, MD</span>
+    <span class="post-meta-dot"></span>
+    <span>November 1, 2026</span>
