+<!-- POST HEADER -->
+<div class="post-header">
+  <p class="post-breadcrumb">
+    <a href="/">Home</a>
+    <span>/</span>
+    Make Room
+  </p>
+  <p class="post-category">Make Room · All Guides</p>
+
+  <h1 class="post-h1">Make Room for <em>What Matters</em></h1>
+
+  <p class="post-script">every guide in one place</p>
+</div>
+
+<!-- POST BODY -->
+<article class="post-body">
+  <p>Make room is the idea underneath everything here. Most of us are not short on discipline or ambition. We are short on space. The calendar was full before we got to the things that matter.</p>
+  <p>These guides are the practical side of that idea. Each one answers a question people actually ask, with scripts, research and small steps you can start this week.</p>
+
+  <h2>Boundaries and saying no</h2>
+  <p>Most of us were rewarded for years for saying yes. These guides are about the other word.</p>
+  <ul>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-set-boundaries">How to Set Boundaries: Examples and Scripts That Work</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-say-no">How to Say No: Polite Scripts for Work, Your Boss and Family</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-stop-people-pleasing">How to Stop People Pleasing: Signs, Causes and Scripts</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/boundaries-with-family">Boundaries With Family at the Holidays: Scripts That Work</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/watch">Best Responses: Short Videos on Saying No, Boundaries and Work</a></li>
+  </ul>
+
+  <h2>Time for what matters</h2>
+  <p>You will not find time. You make room for it.</p>
+  <ul>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-make-time-for-yourself">How to Make Time for Yourself When You're Busy</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/work-life-balance">What Is Work-Life Balance, Really? Signs, Tips, and the 8-8-8 Rule</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/sunday-letter-09-what-will-you-do-with-the-extra-hour#find-your-hour">Find Your Hour: A Ten-Minute Time Audit Worksheet</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/sunday-letter-04-make-room">The Sunday Letter: Make Room</a></li>
+  </ul>
+
+  <h2>Habits and goals</h2>
+  <p>Small, repeated and a little boring. Try it for two weeks.</p>
+  <ul>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-build-a-habit">How to Build a Habit That Sticks</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-keep-new-years-resolutions">How to Keep New Year's Resolutions (and Why Most Fail)</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/make-time-for-healthy-habits">How to Make Time to Exercise and Eat Well When You're Busy</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/sunday-letter-07-three-myths-that-are-costing-you-money-and-sleep">Three Myths That Are Costing You Money and Sleep</a></li>
+  </ul>
+
+  <h2>Work and big decisions</h2>
+  <p>When the job itself is the thing taking up the room.</p>
+  <ul>
+    <li><a href="/how-to-be-happy-at-work">How to Be Happy at Work (Even When You Hate It)</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/should-i-quit-my-job">Should I Quit My Job? Stay or Go Decision Coaching</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/should-i-take-the-promotion">Should I Take the Promotion?</a></li>
+    <li><a href="/decision-coaching">Decision Coaching for Big Life and Career Decisions</a></li>
+  </ul>
+
+  <h2>The Sunday Letter</h2>
+  <p>Every Sunday morning, one idea for making room, plus a podcast, an article and a few things worth having. <a href="/sunday-letter">Read every issue</a> or <a href="/join-emails">get it by email</a>.</p>
+  <h2>On Substack</h2>
+  <p>Longer, more reflective essays live on <a href="https://permissiontochange.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Permission to Change</a>.</p>
+  <h2>Free tools</h2>
+  <p>The Yes Invoice, The 24-Hour Rule, The Second Ask and the Say No Scripts are all free on the <a href="/resources">worksheets page</a>. If you want help applying them to your own week, <a href="/free-session">your first coaching session is free</a>.</p>
+</article>
